      "content": "small changes don't really do anything. they're just distractions. like putting a band-aid on a void. the quiet i'm talking about... it's not just a break from the routine. it's wanting the grayness to actually be gone. i just want to stop existing in this state where i'm just a ghost in my own house. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end, but nothing ever does.",
